1	line	Town crier	Hello citizen!
1	option	What do you do around here?
2	line	Player	What do you do around here?
2	line	Town crier	I'm a Town Crier. It's my job to let people know of any recent news. After all, there's all sorts of things happening around here.
2	line	Player	I see. See you later.
2	line	Town crier	Until next time.
2	action	end
